  "body": "Skip to Main Content\n\nJ A Peyman \n\nPAINTING & DECORATING\n\n07980 577032\n\n\nMy work \nRecent Projects \nA Painter You Can Trust\n\nWith over 37 years of experience in painting and decorating, I take huge pride in delivering quality results on every project. Whether it's a single room refresh or a complete property transformation, entailing panelling for walls, plastering, spraying, wallpapering and many other aspects. I bring the same attention to detail and professional standards to every job. I’m now a fully vetted Which trusted trader .j-a-peyman-painting-and-decorating/reviews\"></iframe>\n\nWHAT I DO\nExpert Services, Exceptional Results\nWallpaper Installation\n\nFrom feature walls to full room installations, I provide precise wallpaper hanging with a flawless finish. \n\nView More\nExterior Decorating\n\nEnhance your property's appearance with my exterior painting. I deliver durable, weather proof results that improve and protect your home.\n\nView More\nInterior Decorating\n\nTransform your home with a design to reflect your personality and style. I can re vamp your living space to make a house a home.  \n\nView More\nFlooring\n\nI sand and repair your old existing flooring and give it a new lease of life and other layer of protection from wear and tear of day to day life.  \n\nView More\nSpraying \n\nI spray walls ceilings ,old furniture, newly built cabinets and refresh old kitchen units to provide an alternative to expensive time consuming refurbs.  \n\nView More",
